	"Name": "Hearths And Hexes Configured",
	"Author": "sargeryong",
	"Description": "\"Hearths And Hexes Configured\" is primarily a configuration pack for the Hearths &amp; Hexes collection, providing many config files and integration changes for the mods used in that pack.\u00A0 It also includes\u00A0some changes to automation mods, such as a small patch for DaLion.Core to force-enable that mod's changes to hopper automation in the presence of Automate and a tweak to Vegas Mid Game Automate to move Hoppers even earlier in progression.\n<br />\n<br />If you aren't using Hearths &amp; Hexes, you probably don't need this.",
